{"3749900": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "CASCADE", "steam_appid": 3749900, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CASCADE is a stylish first-person roguelite with a focus on blazingly fast movement. Slide from surface to surface, unlock and upgrade abilities and face otherworldly enemies and bosses, all while exploring a corrupted digital space. But don't forget: Always keep on moving!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> ━╋━ ━ ━━ ━━ ━━━━╋━   <strong>██████ </strong> <i><strong>CASCADE</strong></i> <strong> ██████   </strong>━╋━━━━ ━━ ━━ ━ ━╋━</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749900/extras/364286c4df7c46e735d1286e957b2cc4.poster.avif?t=1786101218\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749900/extras/364286c4df7c46e735d1286e957b2cc4.webm?t=1786101218\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749900/extras/364286c4df7c46e735d1286e957b2cc4.mp4?t=1786101218\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">██          ━╋━ ━ ━━ ━━ ━━━━╋━━━━ ━━ ━━ ━ ━╋━          ██</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A grave mistake.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Seconds turned to millennia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Stranded alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>But something is watching you.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">██          ━╋━ ━ ━━ ━━ ━━━━╋━━━━ ━━ ━━ ━ ━╋━          ██</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">━╋━ ━ ━━ ━━ ━━━━━╋━   <strong>██████ </strong> <strong>GLIDE &amp; SLIDE  ██████   </strong>━╋━━━━━ ━━ ━━ ━ ━╋━</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749900/extras/ade33cc7127d96ab41f7172971c2096a.poster.avif?t=1786101218\" width=1170 height=526 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749900/extras/ade33cc7127d96ab41f7172971c2096a.webm?t=1786101218\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749900/extras/ade33cc7127d96ab41f7172971c2096a.mp4?t=1786101218\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Glide through the abstract, corrupted world of an ancient computer system in which a digital space has materialized. Slide on its planes to gain speed and recharge your energy. But be careful with your alignment, you don't want to crash!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">━╋━ ━ ━━ ━━ ━━━╋━   <strong>██████</strong>  <strong>BUILD YOUR ABILITIES  ██████   </strong>━╋━━━ ━━ ━━ ━ ━╋━</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749900/extras/79e81a361641d54afd79420276d1a0c7.poster.avif?t=1786101218\" width=1170 height=526 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749900/extras/79e81a361641d54afd79420276d1a0c7.webm?t=1786101218\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749900/extras/79e81a361641d54afd79420276d1a0c7.mp4?t=1786101218\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dash, shoot projectiles, use swords and upgrade your abilities in different ways each run, building your ability into new specializations for different strategies, evolving them to new heights!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">━╋━ ━ ━━ ━━ ━━━━━╋━   <strong>██████</strong>  <strong>FACE ENEMIES  ██████   </strong>━╋━━━━━ ━━ ━━ ━ ━╋━</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749900/extras/228cd765c2396a90a68f80542a5ec6e4.poster.avif?t=1786101218\" width=1170 height=526 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749900/extras/228cd765c2396a90a68f80542a5ec6e4.webm?t=1786101218\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749900/extras/228cd765c2396a90a68f80542a5ec6e4.mp4?t=1786101218\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter many different enemies and react accordingly to their varied behaviors, using your abilities. Adjust your strategy depending on your current build. You might want to evade them, rather than attack!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique First-Person sliding action</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dif